  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-9840-Building a Sustainable EPC Management Cell for Super ESCO PPG-Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the Government of Jordan (GoJ) in accelerating investment in energy efficiency (EE) in public buildings and street lighting by establishing an enabling framework for energy performance contracts (EPCs) and energy service companies (ESCOs) in Jordan. The project responds to national energy policy goals to reduce national dependence on imported fossil fuels.</narrative>
